style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001=
pt;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>There was an interesting patch =
